---
import Section from "./Section.astro";
import { images } from "../config/images";
---

<Section id="interests" label="Outside work">
  <div class="grid gap-10 sm:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] sm:items-start">
    <div class="space-y-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted text-pretty">
      <p>
        Outside of work I really like to play multiple sports, specially football. <br>
        I also like to go to the gym, since it also helps my mind disconnect and helps me stay healthy.
      </p>

      <p>
        My dog comes with me almost everywhere. He is the most chill dog you
        will ever meet, great with people and with other dogs, and his favourite
        place is the beach. Mine too.
      </p>

      <p>
        I love the sea and pretty much anything chill. I am also the person who
        always wants to try the new restaurant, different types of food and drinks are always welcome :D
      </p>
    </div>

    {/* Cropped to 3:4 by the generator, so no object-fit needed here. */}
    <img
      src={images.dog.src}
      srcset={images.dog.srcset}
      sizes={images.dog.sizes}
      width={images.dog.width}
      height={images.dog.height}
      alt="Daniel with his golden retriever on a sunny day"
      loading="lazy"
      class="w-65 max-w-full rounded-lg border border-border"
    />
  </div>
</Section>
